[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 13140.309, "timestamp": "03:39:00", "text": "找不到任何类似的东西。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13142.07, "timestamp": "03:39:02", "text": "在线的。我当时就想，“我的天哪”，因为"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13144.229, "timestamp": "03:39:04", "text": "我第一次听到这件事的时候，就像……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13145.13, "timestamp": "03:39:05", "text": "我以为那是一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13146.429, "timestamp": "03:39:06", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13149.349, "timestamp": "03:39:09", "text": "骗局。我当时真没开玩笑地想：“嗯，听起来……”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13151.15, "timestamp": "03:39:11", "text": "就像骗局一样，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13153.99, "timestamp": "03:39:13", "text": "因为他们使用的是人工智能艺术，而且"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13156.21, "timestamp": "03:39:16", "text": "诸如此类的事情。我当时就想，“好吧，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13158.349, "timestamp": "03:39:18", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 13160.499, "timestamp": "03:39:20", "author": "@Her_escapes", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/k5qSeiW9HuWS-yTlvFtkJFgjFQNzT4clVmOKs1PPP76ezfBidoUedboWgIi3wJy0ffSGpxX2Gy8=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "UCkszU2WH9gy1mb0dV-11UJg/KsIfY6LzFoLM6AKanYDQAg"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13161.75, "timestamp": "03:39:21", "text": "好的。就像，我先看到的是人工智能艺术，然后……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13165.269, "timestamp": "03:39:25", "text": "我看到YouTube订阅者好像不多"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13167.59, "timestamp": "03:39:27", "text": "观点一致之类的。我是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13169.269, "timestamp": "03:39:29", "text": "比如，“好吧，肯定有什么事儿不对劲儿。”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13181.67, "timestamp": "03:39:41", "text": "因为他们有了真正的声音"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13189.51, "timestamp": "03:39:49", "text": "所以他们有正当程序。但我没有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13190.269, "timestamp": "03:39:50", "text": "知道"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13193.15, "timestamp": "03:39:53", "text": "谁在资助他们？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13195.83, "timestamp": "03:39:55", "text": "这。如果真是这样，那他们为什么会这样？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13197.309, "timestamp": "03:39:57", "text": "这样做"}]